    "title": "Lisbon in April",
    "overview": "A balanced, family-focused six-day Lisbon stay with tram rides, pastry stops and a full-day Sintra outing. The itinerary includes Bel\u00e9m Tower and LX Factory, with flexible meals that work for Maya\u2019s vegetarian diet.",
