        "morning": "09:30 take Tram 28 to Gra\u00e7a and walk to the Miradouro da Senhora do Monte for city views.",
        "midday": "12:30 lunch in Alfama; order a vegetarian dish for Maya and simple Portuguese food for Tom and Ada.",
        "afternoon": "14:00 explore Alfama at an unhurried pace, including S\u00e9 Cathedral and a pastry stop.",
        "evening": "18:30 return to the hotel to rest; 20:00 family dinner near the accommodation."
      },
      {
        "day": "2027-04-16",
        "title": "Bel\u00e9m and LX Factory",
